&P338855 = ARM 05, 005 
#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. a-na ia-as2-ma-ah-{d}iszkur 
#tr.ts: ana yasmaḫ-addu 
#tr.en: To Yasmaḫ-Addu  
2. qi2-bi2-ma 
#tr.ts: qibima 
#tr.en: speak!  
3. um-ma ap-la-ha-an-da 
#tr.ts: umma aplaḫanda 
#tr.en: Thus Aplaḫanda,  
4. a-hu-ka-a-ma a-nu-um-ma _gesztin du10-ga_ 
#tr.ts: aḫukama anumma karānam ṭābam 
#tr.en: your brother: Now good wine  
5. usz-ta2-bi-la-kum u3 szi-ti 
#tr.ts: uštābilakkum u šiti
#tr.en: I have sent you; so drink! 
6. a-nu-um#-ma _ninda_ sza kar-ka-mi-isz7#[{ki}] 
#tr.ts: anumma aklum ša karkamiš
#tr.en: Now bread of Carchemish;   
7. u3 a#-ku-ul a-nu-um-ma 1(disz) e-[...] 
#tr.ts: u akul anumma ištēn e-... 
#tr.en: so eat! Now 1 ... ; 
8. a-nu-um-ma _1(disz) har-szu_ bar-[...] 
#tr.ts: anumma ištēn semer qātim bar-... 
#tr.en: now 1 bracelet ... ;  
9. a-nu-um-ma 1(disz) {tug2}su2-nim u3 a-nu#-[um-ma] 
#tr.ts: anumma ištēn sūnim u anumma 
#tr.en: now 1 sūnu(-garment), further now  
10. _1(disz) {tug2}sza3-ga-du3 du8-szi-a_ 
#tr.ts: ištēn šakattâm dušâm  
#tr.en: 1 š(-garment) of dušûm(-stone color) 
11. usz-ta2-bi-la-kum 
#tr.ts: uštābilakkum
#tr.en: I have sent you.  
12. u3 asz-szum a-wa-tim mi-im-ma 
#tr.ts: u aššum awātim mimma 
#tr.en: Further, for the sake of all the terms  
13. a-na s,e-ri-ia szi-tap-pa-ra-am 
#tr.ts: ana ṣēriya šitapparam
#tr.en: to me keep sending!  
14. u3 a-na-ku a-na ma-an-nim 
#tr.ts: u anāku ana mannim 
#tr.en: Further, as for me, to whom
15. a#-na-at,-t,a3-al# 
#tr.ts: anaṭṭal 
#tr.en: will I look? 
